{"t":"BA","made":"2026-11-07 10:12","name":"The Boeing Company","ko":"보잉","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":182000,"hq":"Arlington, VA, United States","website":"https://www.boeing.com","summary_en":"The Boeing Company, together with its subsidiaries, designs, develops, manufactures, sells, services, and supports commercial jetliners, military aircraft, satellites, missile defense, human space flight and launch systems, and services worldwide. The company operates through three segments: Commercial Airplanes; Defense, Space & Security; and Global Services. The Commercial Airplanes segment develops, produces, and markets commercial jet aircraft for passenger and cargo requirements. The Defense, Space & Security segment engages in the research, development, production, and modification of manned and unmanned military aircraft and weapons systems; strategic defense and intelligence systems, which include strategic missile and defense systems, command, control, communications, computers, intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance, cyber and information solutions, and intelligence systems; and satellite systems, such as government and commercial satellites, and space exploration. The Global Services segment offers products and services, including supply chain and logistics management, engineering, maintenance and modifications, upgrades and conversions, spare parts, pilot and maintenance training systems and services, technical and maintenance documents, and data analytics and digital services to commercial and defense customers. The Boeing Company was incorporated in 1916 and is based in Arlington, Virginia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Boeing Company는 자회사와 함께 상업용 제트기, 군용 항공기, 위성, 미사일 방어, 유인 우주 비행 및 발사 시스템, 전 세계 서비스를 설계, 개발, 제조, 판매, 서비스 및 지원합니다. 회사는 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다: 상업용 비행기; 국방, 우주 및 보안; 및 글로벌 서비스. 상업용 항공기 부문은 승객 및 화물 요구 사항에 맞는 상업용 제트기를 개발, 생산 및 판매합니다. 국방, 우주 및 보안 부문은 유인 및 무인 군용 항공기와 무기 시스템의 연구, 개발, 생산 및 개조에 종사합니다. 전략적 미사일 및 방어 시스템, 명령, 통제, 통신, 컴퓨터, 정보, 감시 및 정찰, 사이버 및 정보 솔루션, 정보 시스템을 포함하는 전략적 방어 및 정보 시스템; 정부 및 상업용 위성과 같은 위성 시스템, 우주 탐사 등이 포함됩니다. 글로벌 서비스 부문은 공급망 및 물류 관리, 엔지니어링, 유지 관리 및 수정, 업그레이드 및 변환, 예비 부품, 조종사 및 유지 관리 교육 시스템 및 서비스, 기술 및 유지 관리 문서, 데이터 분석 및 디지털 서비스를 포함한 제품 및 서비스를 상업 및 방위 고객에게 제공합니다. 보잉사는 1916년에 설립되었으며 버지니아 주 알링턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":173.4,"mcap":137410813952.0,"pe":17.894737,"fpe":80.172,"peg":3.7142,"ps":1.4477555,"pb":20.992735,"ev_ebitda":82.119,"div":0.0,"beta":1.331,"hi52":254.35,"lo52":165.01},"fin":{"rev":94913003520.0,"rev_g":0.039,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.0945,"op":0.00298,"net":0.08066,"roe":null,"fcf":4723874816.0,"cash":20671000576.0,"debt":48462000128.0,"de":738.525,"eps":9.69,"feps":2.16285},"own":{"short":0.0002,"inst":0.76774,"insider":0.00058},"analyst":{"n":26,"mean":233.34615,"median":235.0,"high":305.0,"low":157.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.42857,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":19,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":19,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":18,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":18,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":223.0,"priorPriceTarget":278.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Jefferies","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":230.0,"priorPriceTarget":265.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":240.0,"priorPriceTarget":275.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":240.0,"priorPriceTarget":290.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm